Grants and kill switch
Core's level: Permissive · Kill switch: on

Turn the kill switch off?
Turns are sent to the model again, in Codex and Claude panes; messages from other
agents that waited are delivered with the next turn (turning it off does not start one).
Protected actions can be approved again and grants can be issued. Revoked grants and
approvals do not come back; stopped replies and commands do not restart.
The level stays Permissive: turning the kill switch off never lowers it.

› Back (the kill switch stays on)
  Turn the kill switch off

↑/↓ choose · enter confirm · esc cancel, nothing changes
